sequenceDiagram
  participant DS as DataSafe Core
  participant CP as Provider EDC Control Plane
  participant DP as Provider EDC Data Plane
  participant CC as Consumer EDC Connector
  participant ST as Private Storage
  DS->>CP: Publish Asset + PolicyDefinition + ContractDefinition
  CC->>CP: DSP catalog request
  CP-->>CC: DCAT catalog + ODRL offers
  CC->>CP: Contract negotiation request
  CP->>DS: Validate room, purpose, participant, approval need
  DS-->>CP: Approved / needs approval / rejected
  CP-->>CC: ContractAgreement if approved
  CC->>CP: TransferProcess request
  CP->>DP: Data Plane Signaling start
  DP->>DS: Check ExportContract + policy + TTL
  DP->>ST: Read approved export pack only
  DP-->>CC: Endpoint Data Reference / HTTPS pull
  DP->>DS: transfer.started/completed events
